    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d362">

                <pb facs="0638" n="512" sameAs="frus:frus1925v01/pg512"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.75/9</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Albania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Hart</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tirana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-12-16"><hi rendition="#italic">December 16,
                        1925.</hi></date><lb/>[Received January 11, 1926.]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 44</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Engagements made by the Albanian state as
                    the conditions upon which recognition was granted by the American Government <pb
                        facs="0639" n="513" xml:id="pg513"/> on July 28, 1922,<anchor n="28"
                        xml:id="d362-f1"/> have at last been removed from the field of controversy,
                    as I had the honor to report in my telegram No. 63 of December 14, 8 p.m.<anchor
                        n="29" xml:id="d362-f2"/> By a unanimous vote both houses of parliament have
                    approved these conventions in substantially the form set forth in the note of
                    Djafer Ypi, president of the Council of Ministers, to Maxwell Blake, American
                    Commissioner, under date of June 25, 1922.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <p>Included herewith are copies of the measure as approved and of the report of the
                    Minister for Foreign Affairs.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Chas. C. Hart</hi></signed></closer>




                <xi:include href="d362-a1.xml" xpointer="d362-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d362-a2.xml" xpointer="d362-a2"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
